# ---- Fonts: 33 MB of TTF, 94% of the repo ------------------------------------
#  Noto Sans SC is OFL-licensed and free to redistribute, but committing 33 MB
#  into git makes every clone slow forever. They are only needed to render
#  Chinese PDFs. Download instructions are in the README.
assets/fonts/*.ttf
